<title>USA: Enzo finds cholesterol-reducing compound.</title>
<headline>Enzo finds cholesterol-reducing compound.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enzo Biochem Inc on Wednesday said its researchers had developed compounds related to the regulation of serum cholesterol levels.</p>
<p>The Japanese patent office also awarded Enzo a patent covering aspects of its non-isotopic labeling and detection technology, the company said.</p>
<p>The award broadened Enzo's patent coverage in the area of soluble assays to detect the hepatitis B virus, HIV and other pathogens, it said.</p>
</text>
